  "description": "This walk takes you to Lough Anaserd from the village of Ballyconneely in west County Galway on the Slyne Head peninsula. You can follow a quiet country lane and footpaths west from the village to reach the lough. There's some nice views here over the water to the surrounding countryside.You can continue your walking in the area by heading north to visitClifden Castle.",
